# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# 🔴 Cargo.lock is NOT ignored. This workspace ships binaries, and
# the editor copies the lock into every project it vendors itself
# into — so an unversioned one means the resolution that reaches a
# game is whichever machine happened to build it (#684).

